Backport https://github.com/NixOS/nix/pull/16581 to Nix 2.35.2.
Upstream commit: 29ddc0eecd85beb135ad4a7468b6d04608857584

Keep the interrupt-only registry used by this release. Skip the reset for
Linux vfork children, which share the parent's address space, and cover that
with an additional regression test. Retain the upstream fork isolation,
inherited-handle removal, and inherited-lock regression tests unchanged.

Omit the upstream daemon SIGWINCH stress test: SIGWINCH does not use the
callback registry in 2.35.2. The deterministic unit test exercises the
inherited-lock deadlock directly. Drop this backport once the packaged
release includes the upstream fix.

